---
<section id="process">
  <div class="process-band">
    <div class="process-band__inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="kr-eyebrow">The journey</div>
        <h2>How a move with us goes</h2>
        <p>Whether it's your first home or your fifth, the path is the same: considered, transparent, and entirely guided.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process__cards">

        <div class="process-card">
          <div class="process-card__top">
            <div class="process-card__icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="process-card__num">01</span>
          </div>
          <h3>A conversation first</h3>
          <p>We start by listening — your hopes, your constraints, your timeline. No pressure, no obligation. Just a clear, honest read on where you stand.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
          <div class="process-card__top">
            <div class="process-card__icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polygon points="3 11 22 2 13 21 11 13 3 11"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="process-card__num">02</span>
          </div>
          <h3>A plan made for you</h3>
          <p>We translate the whole process into a simple, personal roadmap — pricing, prep, timing, financing — so you always know what comes next and why.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
          <div class="process-card__top">
            <div class="process-card__icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="process-card__num">03</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Guided every step</h3>
          <p>From showings and offers to inspections and paperwork, we're a step ahead of each decision, explaining the trade-offs in plain language.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
          <div class="process-card__top">
            <div class="process-card__icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="process-card__num">04</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Across the finish line</h3>
          <p>We handle the details and the negotiations so the closing feels calm. And we stay in touch long after the keys change hands.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
